7. Product Goals
Goal 1
Enable students to quickly identify eligible colleges based on cutoff.

Goal 2
Help students understand engineering branches and career paths.

Goal 3
Provide historical cutoff trend visibility.

Goal 4
Support informed counseling preference selection.

Goal 5
Provide conversational guidance using AI.

