9. User Journeys
Journey 1: College Recommendation
Student enters:

Cutoff
Community
Preferred Branch
System returns:

Dream Colleges
Target Colleges
Safe Colleges
Journey 2: College Search
Student searches by:

College Name
College Code
District
System displays:

Details
Programs
Historical Cutoffs
Journey 3: Branch Exploration
Student selects branch.

System displays:

Overview
Core Subjects
Career Domains
Related Branches
Journey 4: AI Guidance
Student asks:

"I got 185 cutoff. Which colleges can I expect for CSE?"

System:

Queries project data
Generates recommendation
Explains reasoning
