13. Release Roadmap
Release 1: MVP
Duration:

8 Weeks

Goal:

Provide college recommendations based on cutoff.

Features:

College Search
Branch Explorer
Cutoff Explorer
Recommendation Engine
Success Criteria:

A student can obtain meaningful recommendations within 2 minutes.

Release 2: Smart Recommendations
Duration:

6 Weeks

Goal:

Improve recommendation quality.

Features:

Match Score
Trend Analysis
College Comparison
Success Criteria:

More personalized recommendations.

Release 3: AI Counselor
Duration:

4 Weeks

Goal:

Provide conversational guidance.

Features:

AI Chat Interface
RAG Search
Recommendation Explanations
Success Criteria:

Students receive data-backed answers.

Release 4: Counseling Companion
Duration:

4 Weeks

Goal:

Support counseling preparation.

Features:

Eligibility Checker
Document Checklist
Preference Generator
Success Criteria:

Students can simulate counseling preparation.

