19. Definition of Success
Version 1 Success
A student can:

Enter cutoff
Select community
Select branch
And receive useful recommendations.

Version 2 Success
A student can:

Compare colleges
Understand trends
Make informed decisions
Version 3 Success
A student can:

Ask questions naturally
Receive trustworthy answers
Understand recommendation reasoning
20. Golden Rule
Before implementing any feature, ask:

Will this directly help a Tamil Nadu engineering student make a better college or branch decision?

If the answer is No, move the idea to the backlog.

This rule protects the project from unnecessary complexity and ensures continuous focus on student value.
